WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:03.202
-Hey, guys, The Players
Championship was this weekend,

00:00:03.202 --> 00:00:05.137
and we wanted to do
something fun with that,

00:00:05.137 --> 00:00:07.206
so we gave a bunch
of the players weird phrases

00:00:07.206 --> 00:00:09.942
and asked them to sneak those
phrases into their interviews

00:00:09.942 --> 00:00:11.410
as casually as possible.

00:00:11.410 --> 00:00:13.046
No one knew
we were gonna do this.

00:00:13.046 --> 00:00:15.949
Here. Check it out.
It's time for "Drop It In."

00:00:15.949 --> 00:00:18.151
-♪ Drop it in, drop it in ♪

00:00:18.151 --> 00:00:21.320
♪ Droppa, droppa,
drop it in, yeah ♪

00:00:21.320 --> 00:00:23.823 line:0%
-Florida golf
and California golf.

00:00:23.823 --> 00:00:27.127 line:0%
Can you compare and contrast?

00:00:27.127 --> 00:00:28.627 line:0%
-Yeah, I mean, it's interesting.

00:00:28.627 --> 00:00:33.165 line:0%
This week, compared to when
we normally play this event,

00:00:33.165 --> 00:00:35.801 line:0%
it's more green, you know?

00:00:35.801 --> 00:00:37.703 line:0%
I'm used to it being
a little more bone-dry.

00:00:37.703 --> 00:00:42.541 line:0%
The rough just seems to be
sort of sweet sassy mollassy.

00:00:42.541 --> 00:00:44.477 line:0%
-Just talk a little bit
about how excited you are

00:00:44.477 --> 00:00:47.446 line:0%
to be back and also to have
the fans here this week.

00:00:47.446 --> 00:00:48.782 line:0%
-Well, yeah, you know,

00:00:48.782 --> 00:00:50.683 line:0%
I'm just corn dog
living a hot-dog life

00:00:50.683 --> 00:00:52.051 line:0%
out there now again.

00:00:52.051 --> 00:00:54.253 line:0%
-Now that we're at 20% capacity,

00:00:54.253 --> 00:00:56.456 line:0%
how much are you looking forward
to that aspect?

00:00:56.456 --> 00:00:58.525 line:0%
-Yeah, well,
you know, to be honest,

00:00:58.525 --> 00:01:00.960 line:0%
khakis with the pleats
and feet in their cleats

00:01:00.960 --> 00:01:03.396 line:0%
keep butts in their seats.
Um...

00:01:03.396 --> 00:01:05.064 line:0%
-Putting, you take
great pride in.

00:01:05.064 --> 00:01:07.233 line:0%
Could you talk a little bit
about that part of your game?

00:01:07.233 --> 00:01:10.069 line:0%
-Well, I love putting.
I'm a putt putt nut nut.

00:01:10.069 --> 00:01:11.671 line:0%
Can I get a what, what?

00:01:11.671 --> 00:01:12.972 line:0%
-I think I just learned that

00:01:12.972 --> 00:01:15.308 line:0%
you have to respect
the golf course.

00:01:15.308 --> 00:01:16.676 line:0%
There's trouble on every hole.

00:01:16.676 --> 00:01:18.144 line:0%
You can try to pin the tail
on the donkey,

00:01:18.144 --> 00:01:20.513 line:0%
but eventually you're gonna
get kicked in the teeth.

00:01:20.513 --> 00:01:23.449 line:0%
-I've never been known
to skip on the dip.

00:01:23.449 --> 00:01:25.518 line:0%
-Just curious --
your thoughts on the 17th,

00:01:25.518 --> 00:01:28.688 line:0%
of the tee shot,
if it's intimidating or not.

00:01:28.688 --> 00:01:31.757 line:0%
-Simple truth is...
you know, we have the meats.

00:01:31.757 --> 00:01:33.359 line:0%
We have what we need, you know?

00:01:33.359 --> 00:01:35.928 line:0%
You gotta go up there and be
great. It's as simple as that.

00:01:35.928 --> 00:01:38.164 line:0%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:38.164 --> 00:01:41.067
"Simple truth is...
we have the meats."

00:01:41.067 --> 00:01:43.202
Oh, my goodness.
That was great.

00:01:43.202 --> 00:01:45.271
Thank you to all the players
who helped us with that.

